OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murdering his
OL,4,Aex-colleague
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been convicted of murder
OL,7,Fafter fatally stabbing a former
OL,8,Fcolleague in Birmingham.
OL,10,FAhmad Alkozai was found guilty at
OL,11,FBirmingham Crown Court on Thursday
OL,12,Fafter attacking Muhammad Umair on
OL,13,FWalford Road, Sparkbrook on 4 June.
OL,15,FPolice said Alkozai had never explained
OL,16,Fwhy he stabbed Umair, but that he had
OL,17,Ftried to flee, before being arrested in
OL,18,FBristol in the early hours of the
OL,19,Ffollowing morning.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
